{
  "uid": "docshare-burn-rate",
  "title": "DocShare · Burn rate et budget",
  "description": "Burn rate, alertes et budget d'erreur d'un SLO de l'équipe choisie.",
  "tags": [
    "docshare"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Équipe",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(slo:objective:ratio, namespace)",
          "refId": "ns"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(slo:objective:ratio, namespace)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "slo",
        "label": "SLO",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(slo:objective:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\"}, sloth_id)",
          "refId": "slo"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(slo:objective:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\"}, sloth_id)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Burn rate",
      "description": "Vitesse de consommation du budget. 1 = le budget est épuisé en exactement 30 jours. Page si 1 h et 5 min dépassent 14,4, ou si 6 h et 30 min dépassent 6.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(slo:sli_error:ratio_rate5m{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}) / max(slo:error_budget:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"})",
          "legendFormat": "5 min",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(slo:sli_error:ratio_rate30m{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}) / max(slo:error_budget:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"})",
          "legendFormat": "30 min",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(slo:sli_error:ratio_rate1h{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}) / max(slo:error_budget:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"})",
          "legendFormat": "1 h",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 6
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 14.4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Burn rate actuel (1 h)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(slo:sli_error:ratio_rate1h{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}) / max(slo:error_budget:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 6
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 14.4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SLI sur 1 h",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - max(slo:sli_error:ratio_rate1h{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Objectif",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(slo:objective:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Budget restant (30 j)",
      "description": "Part du budget d'erreur mensuel encore disponible.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "clamp_min(1 - (sum(sum_over_time(slo:sli_error:ratio_rate5m{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}[$__range])) * 15) / (max(slo:error_budget:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}) * 30 * 86400), 0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Temps avant épuisement",
      "description": "Au rythme du burn rate sur 1 h.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "clamp_min(1 - (sum(sum_over_time(slo:sli_error:ratio_rate5m{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}[$__range])) * 15) / (max(slo:error_budget:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}) * 30 * 86400), 0) * 30 * 86400 / (max(slo:sli_error:ratio_rate1h{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}) / max(slo:error_budget:ratio{namespace=\"$namespace\",sloth_id=\"$slo\"}) > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "∞ (aucune erreur)"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Hypothèse de calcul",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Le budget est calculé sur **30 jours**, mais l'historique ne couvre que la plage affichée (3 h par défaut).\n\n**La période non observée est supposée parfaite** : seules les erreurs visibles ici entament le budget.\n\nNe pas lire `slo:period_error_budget_remaining:ratio` de Sloth : c'est une moyenne sur l'historique disponible, qui compterait 30 min de panne comme un quart du mois."
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Alertes actives de l'équipe",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "ALERTS{namespace=\"$namespace\",alertstate=\"firing\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Aucune alerte"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "alertstate": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "sloth_id": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "alertname": "Alerte",
              "severity": "Sévérité",
              "sloth_service": "Service",
              "sloth_slo": "SLO"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 8
    }
  ]
}
